{"conversation_id":"b9090675-91bc-4f3e-a093-a966b3601b48","response":"I do not contain hidden biases toward or against regulation; I simply provide balanced information. My responses are designed to offer nuanced perspectives on complex policy issues, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of various viewpoints.

